{"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"platforms":[{"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0"},{"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0"},{"name":"tvOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0"},{"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"1.0"},{"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"11.0"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSRadio"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents9OUDSRadioV","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"title":"OUDSRadio","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSRadio"}],"roleHeading":"Structure"},"abstract":[{"text":"Radio button is a UI element that allows to select a single option from a set of mutually exclusive choices.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Radio button that does not show icon or text, provides greater flexibility when creating other components that require a Radio button to be displayed.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadio\/init(isOn:accessibilityLabel:isError:isReadOnly:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadio\/body"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifie